{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a828925361f4c5dd","name":"Iron Knight Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-a828925361f4c5dd","title":"Iron Knight Talent Tree","revision":20455,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:52:51Z","sha256":"bff81809ea5242d5cc5ea4211251f74760174c8d5eed10b8a065dff7a98e0601","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20455","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Iron%20Knight%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a828925361f4c5dd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Iron Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Iron_Knights","referenceId":"reference:9e7bf26f028674eb"}," are truly unique, in that they are silicon-based creatures that use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," as their physical bodies to interact with the galaxy. As a result, they view and utilize ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," in ways that seem unusual to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Most of their powers involve their ability to affect ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," and other machinery. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Iron Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Iron_Knights","referenceId":"reference:9e7bf26f028674eb"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Droid Duelist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to cause an opponent to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against your next attack made with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," before the end of your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Repair"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Trance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Trance"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill to recover ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural Healing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural_Healing"},". You can also receive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," from the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vital Transfer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vital_Transfer","referenceId":"reference:7a951a090c700baf"}]}," Force Power. Whenever you receive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," from any source, you gain additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier (minimum +1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Heal Droid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vital Transfer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vital_Transfer","referenceId":"reference:7a951a090c700baf"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vital Transfer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vital_Transfer","referenceId":"reference:7a951a090c700baf"}]}," Force Power to heal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shard","referenceId":"reference:75f11815c8f97301"},"-inhabited ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"), which are normally immune to this Force Power. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mask Presence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you become immune to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Force"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, and appear to be nothing more than a regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". If you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check or use any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent"},", this effect immediately ends. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Silicon Mind"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Other Force-users have a difficult time knowing how to influence you. You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to gain a bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier (minimum +1) against all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
